  "body": "Clear vendor instructions: This property must be sold.\r\n\r\nA shift in circumstances demands an immediate result, opening an extraordinary opportunity in one of East Auckland's most coveted peninsula locations. Positioned along prestige-laden Musick Point Road-surrounded by premium coastal amenities, top school zones, and walking access to the beach-this is a rare chance to secure prime Bucklands Beach real estate under genuine urgency.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to capitalise on the location, secure a blue-chip long-term asset, or take full advantage of a highly motivated seller, the directive is unequivocal: meet the market.\r\n\r\nAll conditional and unconditional offers will be presented immediately. Opportunities of this calibre in such an elite address do not linger-contact the agent today, register your interest, and present your offer without delay.\r\n\r\nThe instructions from the vendor could not be clearer: this property must be sold. Due to an immediate change in circumstances, the owners have issued a strict directive to meet the market without delay, creating an exceptional window of opportunity for decisive buyers, savvy investors, and opportunists alike.\r\n\r\nTime is of the essence. We are instructed to present every written offer directly to the seller for immediate consideration. Whether you are seeking a prime addition to your portfolio, an entry-level foothold, or a high-upside project, this is a genuine chance to secure a transaction under highly motivated terms.\r\n\r\nHesitation will lead to regret. Do not wait for the market to move ahead of you-inspect promptly, conduct your due diligence, and present your offer today.\r\n\r\nAfter 42 cherished years of ownership, the current vendor is ready to sell. This rare beachfront opportunity will be sold-act quickly to secure your slice of prime coastal real estate.\r\n\r\nCoastal Living: Dual-Property Beachfront Haven on 1,366sqm\r\n\r\nEmbrace the ultimate beachfront lifestyle with this rare offering of two distinct residences set on a massive 1,366sqm flat section. Positioned directly on the waterfront, this premier estate captures sweeping, unblocked ocean views and offers direct beach access right from your front lawn. Bordered by a tranquil nature reserve, the property enjoys an immersive natural backdrop filled with native birdlife and the soothing sounds of the tide.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights & Accommodation\r\n\r\n1,366sqm Flat Section: Expansive, level grounds featuring a standalone double garage, a second double internal garage, and generous space to easily accommodate a boat, caravan, and a future swimming pool.\r\n\r\nDirect Beach Access & Reserve Privacy: Step straight off your lawn onto the sand, backed by the peace and privacy of the neighboring nature reserve, creating a peaceful and natural environment. Wake up to the melodious singing of birds, adding a touch of nature's music to your daily routine.\r\n\r\nTop-Tier School Zoning: In zone for highly desirable Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and Bucklands Beach Primary School.\r\n\r\nThe Main Residence\r\n\r\nGround Level: Bright open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area with a full bathroom, separate spacious lounge, leading into a grand ballroom complete with its own separate bathroom-ideal for hosting events or converting into a specialized retreat.\r\n\r\nSecond Level: Three generous bedrooms, including a master suite with private ensuite, alongside a family bathroom and an additional separate toilet.\r\n\r\nThird Level: Flexible loft space suitable as a fourth bedroom, executive office, or elevated media room.\r\n\r\nThe Second Residence \r\n\r\nFeatures: A fully self-contained home boasting four bedrooms, open-plan kitchen, dining, and living spaces, two bathrooms, and an integrated double internal-access garage. Perfect for multi-generational living, hosting guests, or generating rental income. Whether envisioned as a multi-generational family estate, a coastal sanctuary, or a high-reward investment, this property delivers a lifestyle of scale, luxury, and location.\r\n\r\nContact John Wang 021668287 today to arrange a private viewing or visit during the upcoming open home",
